CINS/
   CNet Internet Shell, and assorted utility for it.

bbgopher/
   CNetC version of bbgopher for CNet/4

DupeScan/
   CNetC dupe account scanner.

4.x/
   Assorted CNet/4 utility sources.

lv.c
   GadTools listview test program

lv2.c
   Another GadTools listview test program

ToggleMiami.c
   CLI util to toggle Miami state

ToggleMiamiDx.c
   CLI util to toggle MiamiDx interfaces


NOTE:
   All sources included within this archive are supplied as-is. You may use this
source as you wish, with the following restrictions:
   * You may not use it in a commercial program without my express permission.
   * If you use any of my source in one of your programs, I'd like an email
     stating such (just to get a feel for who is using it, and if it's
     helpful to anyone)

Any questions on any of the source, feel free to drop me a line.  I'll try to
help out as I can on it.

